"buy.t.s1":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {uz} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 09:00 Kyiv time. Choose a suitable train and pay for the ticket.","buy.t.s1one":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {uz} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 09:00 Kyiv time. Choose the train and pay for the ticket.",
"buy.t.s2":"Buy the {pkp} ticket separately from the Polish carrier PKP Intercity, on intercity.pl or in the PKP Intercity app. You can also buy it on koleo.pl or in the KOLEO app.",
"buy.t3out":"When choosing the {pkp} train, use the options and timetable shown above on this page. Allow for the arrival time of the {uz} train and the length of the transfer.",
"buy.t3in":"When choosing the {pkp} train, use the options and timetable shown above on this page. Allow for the departure time of the {uz} train and the length of the transfer.",
"buy.t.s4":"After buying, save both e-tickets on your phone. Before you travel, check the dates, departure times and arrival stations.",
"buy.t.b1":"Buy the {uz} ticket in the UZ app","buy.t.b2":"Buy the {pkp} ticket on PKP Intercity",
"buy.note":"Train schedules may change. Check the latest information in the UZ app and on the PKP Intercity website.",
"buy.t.s1z":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {uz} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 08:00 Kyiv time. Choose a suitable train and pay for the ticket.","buy.t.s2zk":"The {pkp} train departs the next day, so ticket sales for it in the Ukrzaliznytsia app open the following day. If you want to buy a ticket in advance, you can buy it separately in the app of the Slovak carrier ZSSK. ZSSK tickets are usually cheaper.","buy.d.s3z":"Pick a seat and pay by bank card. The e-ticket will appear in the app. Show it with your passport when boarding.","buy.d.s2v":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {dir} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 08:00 Kyiv time. Tickets for the direct train are in high demand, so we recommend buying them as soon as sales open.","buy.d.s2z":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {dir} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 08:00 Kyiv time.","buy.t.s2c":"Buy the {pkp} ticket separately from the Romanian carrier CFR Călători, on bilete.cfrcalatori.ro.","buy.t.b2c":"Buy the {pkp} ticket on CFR","buy.note.c":"Train schedules may change. Check the latest information in the UZ app and on the CFR Călători website.","transfer.h3":"With a transfer","buy.t.s1v":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the train you need on the Ukrainian part of the route and set the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure, at 08:00 Kyiv time. Pay for the ticket.","buy.t.s2v":"Buy the ticket for the rest of the journey separately, for example from the Austrian carrier ÖBB, on tickets.oebb.at or in the ÖBB Tickets app.","buy.t.b1v":"Buy a ticket in the UZ app","buy.t.b2v":"Buy a ticket on ÖBB","buy.h.s1":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {bud1} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure, at 08:00 Kyiv time. Choose a train and pay for the ticket.","buy.h.s2":"You can buy the {bud2} ticket from the Hungarian carrier MÁV, on jegy.mav.hu or in the MÁVPlusz app, or from the Austrian carrier ÖBB, on tickets.oebb.at or in the ÖBB Tickets app.","buy.h.b1":"Buy the {bud1} ticket in the UZ app","buy.h.b2":"Buy the {bud2} ticket on MÁV","buy.h.b3":"Buy the {bud2} ticket on ÖBB","buy.t.s1vk":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {uz} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 08:00 Kyiv time. Choose train 028Л and pay for the ticket.","buy.t.s2vk":"Buy the ticket for the {pkp} train in the Ukrzaliznytsia app. You can also buy a ticket in advance from the Austrian carrier ÖBB, on tickets.oebb.at or in the ÖBB Tickets app. In that case it will be considerably more expensive than in the Ukrzaliznytsia app.","buy.t.s1kv":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {uz} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 08:00 Kyiv time. Choose train 027К and pay for the ticket.","buy.t.s2ov":"The {pkp} trains depart the next day, so ticket sales for them in the Ukrzaliznytsia app open the following day. You can also buy a ticket in advance from the Austrian carrier ÖBB, on tickets.oebb.at or in the ÖBB Tickets app. In that case it will be considerably more expensive than in the Ukrzaliznytsia app.","buy.t.s2o":"Buy the {pkp} ticket separately from the Austrian carrier ÖBB, on tickets.oebb.at or in the ÖBB Tickets app.","buy.t.b2o":"Buy the {pkp} ticket on ÖBB","buy.note.o":"Train schedules may change. Check the latest information in the UZ app and on the ÖBB website.","buy.t.s2z":"You can buy the {pkp} ticket in the Ukrzaliznytsia app or separately from the Slovak carrier ZSSK in its app. Tickets from ZSSK are usually cheaper.","buy.t.b2z":"Buy the {pkp} ticket in the ZSSK app","buy.note.z":"Train schedules may change. Check the latest information in the UZ app and in the ZSSK app.",
"buy.a.s1":"Open the Ukrzaliznytsia app, choose the route {dir} and the travel date. Sales open 20 days before departure at 09:00 Kyiv time.",
